#: ../../09-testing.md 73a17110782e4346be5fd63cdc23d8ff
msgid ""
"libfreeswitch / core. Framework: FCT via `src/include/test/switch_test.h` "
"and `src/include/test/switch_fct.h`. Each binary is a separate process."
