#: ../../09-testing.md:71 b92439c47c6b4b72bf4735428c343c3f
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Fixtures**: per-suite XML under `tests/unit/conf/` (shared core), "
"`conf_sip/`, `conf_sofia/`, `conf_rtp/`, `conf_stun/`, `conf_verto/`, "
"`conf_event_socket/`, `conf_eavesdrop/`, `conf_test/`, `conf_tts_format/`, "
"`conf_playsay/`, `conf_async/`. RTP pcaps: "
"`tests/unit/pcap/milliwatt*.pcap`. Images: "
"`tests/unit/images/{banner,signalwire}.png`. Module tests often ship their "
"own `test/conf` (for example `src/mod/endpoints/mod_sofia/test/`)."
msgstr ""
"**夹具**：套件 XML 在 "
"`tests/unit/conf/`（共享核心）、`conf_sip/`、`conf_sofia/`、`conf_rtp/`、`conf_stun/`、`conf_verto/`、`conf_event_socket/`、`conf_eavesdrop/`、`conf_test/`、`conf_tts_format/`、`conf_playsay/`、`conf_async/`。RTP"
" "
"pcap：`tests/unit/pcap/milliwatt*.pcap`。图像：`tests/unit/images/{banner,signalwire}.png`。模块测试常常自带"
" `test/conf`（例如 `src/mod/endpoints/mod_sofia/test/`）。"

#: ../../09-testing.md:72 6bf7034432a64a1b97e2ae37d1424109
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**State isolation**: `FST_CORE_BEGIN` / `FST_CORE_DB_BEGIN` / "
"`FST_MINCORE_BEGIN` in `switch_test.h` call `fst_init_core_and_modload()`, "
"point `conf_dir` at the suite directory, and put `log_dir` / `db_dir` under "
"a **PID** subdirectory. `FST_CORE_END` calls `switch_core_destroy()`. Tests "
"run **one binary at a time** inside a chunk (`run-tests.sh` sequential `make"
" -f run-tests.mk`). CI uses `--privileged` and writes cores to "
"`/cores/core.%s.%E.%e.%p.%t`."
msgstr ""
"**状态隔离**：`switch_test.h` 中的 `FST_CORE_BEGIN` / `FST_CORE_DB_BEGIN` / "
"`FST_MINCORE_BEGIN` 会调用 `fst_init_core_and_modload()`，把 `conf_dir` 指到套件目录，并把"
" `log_dir` / `db_dir` 放到 **PID** 子目录下。`FST_CORE_END` 调用 "
"`switch_core_destroy()`。每个分片内测试**一次只跑一个二进制**（`run-tests.sh` 顺序执行 `make -f "
"run-tests.mk`）。CI 使用 `--privileged`，并把 core 写到 `/cores/core.%s.%E.%e.%p.%t`。"

#: ../../09-testing.md:73 d48f46aa03f5450fbe489cfc186d0967
msgid ""
"**External dependencies**: Sofia-SIP is cloned from `freeswitch/sofia-sip` "
"(not vendored). Unit-test image: `signalwire/freeswitch-public-ci-"
"base:bookworm-amd64`. Extra apt in `unit-test.yml`: `libpcre2-dev`, "
"`libsphinxbase-dev`, `libpocketsphinx-dev`. ASAN: `--enable-address-"
"sanitizer --enable-fake-dlclose` plus "
"`ASAN_OPTIONS=log_path=stdout:disable_coredump=0:unmap_shadow_on_exit=1:fast_unwind_on_malloc=0`"
" (workflow env and `ci.sh`)."
msgstr ""
"**外部依赖**：Sofia-SIP 从 `freeswitch/sofia-sip` "
"克隆（未内置）。单元测试镜像：`signalwire/freeswitch-public-ci-base:bookworm-amd64`。`unit-"
"test.yml` 额外 apt：`libpcre2-dev`、`libsphinxbase-dev`、`libpocketsphinx-"
"dev`。ASAN：`--enable-address-sanitizer --enable-fake-dlclose`，加上 "
"`ASAN_OPTIONS=log_path=stdout:disable_coredump=0:unmap_shadow_on_exit=1:fast_unwind_on_malloc=0`（工作流环境和"
" `ci.sh`）。"

#: ../../09-testing.md:74 e899d03bd69449488143286edd88cff9
msgid ""
"**Chunking**: `./run-tests.sh [chunks] [chunk_number]` round-robins the "
"`print_tests` list. Default CI is **2 groups** (`ci.yml` `TOTAL_GROUPS: 2`)."
" Optional DinD (`workflow_dispatch` input `dind`) uses `tests/unit/run-"
"tests-docker.sh` with `MAX_CONTAINERS: 8` (`.github/workflows/unit-test-"
"dind.yml`) and `.github/docker/debian/bookworm/amd64/CI/Dockerfile`."
msgstr ""
"**分片**：`./run-tests.sh [chunks] [chunk_number]` 对 `print_tests` 列表做 round-"
"robin。默认 CI 是 **2 组**（`ci.yml` 的 `TOTAL_GROUPS: 2`）。可选 "
"DinD（`workflow_dispatch` 输入 `dind`）使用 `tests/unit/run-tests-"
"docker.sh`，`MAX_CONTAINERS: 8`（`.github/workflows/unit-test-dind.yml`）以及 "
"`.github/docker/debian/bookworm/amd64/CI/Dockerfile`。"

#: ../../09-testing.md:76 deeb68c557bf44edb82248fc5005d59a
msgid ""
"Failed binaries keep `log_run-tests_*.html` (via `ansi2html` in `test.sh`); "
"`collect-test-logs.sh --dir logs --print` builds `artifacts.html` and dumps "
"text when `html2text` is installed."
msgstr ""
"失败的二进制会保留 `log_run-tests_*.html`（经 `test.sh` 中的 `ansi2html`）；`collect-test-"
"logs.sh --dir logs --print` 生成 `artifacts.html`，并在安装了 `html2text` 时转储文本。"

