#: ../../09-testing.md:105 31208b8e5e3c4360a01928b4327d05bc
msgid ""
"After a normal `./configure && make && make install` (without `ci.sh` ASAN "
"flags), the same `tests/unit/run-tests.sh` still applies; `make print_tests`"
" from the **build root** is what the runner calls (`tests/unit/run-"
"tests.sh`). Top-level `make check` recurses `src/mod` (`check: "
"$(OUR_CHECK_MODULES)`) and `tests/unit` (`SUBDIRS`). That runs enabled-"
"module `TESTS` plus core unit binaries. It does **not** run `libs/esl` — "
"that tree is not in top-level `SUBDIRS`; CI calls `make -C libs/esl check` "
"separately."
msgstr ""
"在普通 `./configure && make && make install` 之后（不带 `ci.sh` 的 ASAN 标志），同样的 "
"`tests/unit/run-tests.sh` 仍然适用；运行器调用的是**构建根目录**上的 `make "
"print_tests`（`tests/unit/run-tests.sh`）。顶层 `make check` 会递归 "
"`src/mod`（`check: $(OUR_CHECK_MODULES)`）和 `tests/unit`（`SUBDIRS`）。这会运行已启用模块的"
" `TESTS` 加上核心单元二进制。它**不会**跑 `libs/esl`——该树不在顶层 `SUBDIRS` 中；CI 单独调用 `make -C "
"libs/esl check`。"

